An accepted plus follower keeps its column through an indented quote prefix

```
> - - +
  > x
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <ul>
        <li>x</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```

```
> - - - +
  >   x
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <ul>
            <li>x</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```
